// Silk, the fixer (hub POI 8). Gives M1 Rat Trap and M2 Chop Job, and pays for them.
// openspec/changes/sump-market-hub, design section 2; dialog-and-social for the format.
{
  "id": "silk", "name": "Silk",
  "starts": [
    {"if": [{"not_flag": "met_silk"}], "node": "first"},
    {"node": "desk"}
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "first": {
      "say": [
        "So you're the one who came down the service stairs with no papers and a good pair of boots.",
        "Silk. I find people problems, and I find problems people. You look like the second kind."
      ],
      "do": [{"flag": "met_silk"}, {"objective": "t0_arrival/meet_silk"}, {"complete_quest": "t0_arrival"}],
      "next": "desk"
    },
    "desk": {
      "say": ["What do you need?"],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "You said you had work.", "if": [{"quest": "m1_rat_trap", "state": "not_started"}], "next": "m1_offer"},
        {"text": "Anything bigger?", "if": [{"quest": "m2_chop_job", "state": "not_started"}], "next": "m2_offer"},
        {"text": "Your rates are an insult. Twenty-five percent more, or find another runner.",
         "if": [{"not_flag": "silk_fee_up"}], "check": {"skill": "persuasion", "dc": 3}, "pass": "fee_up"},
        {"text": "The sanitation crew are out.",
         "if": [{"quest": "m1_rat_trap"}, {"objective": "m1_rat_trap/out"}, {"not_flag": "silk_fee_up"}],
         "do": [{"complete_quest": "m1_rat_trap"}, {"credits": 800}, {"flag": "m1_done"}, {"rep": "residents", "delta": 5}],
         "next": "m1_paid"},
        {"text": "The sanitation crew are out.",
         "if": [{"quest": "m1_rat_trap"}, {"objective": "m1_rat_trap/out"}, {"flag": "silk_fee_up"}],
         "do": [{"complete_quest": "m1_rat_trap"}, {"credits": 1000}, {"flag": "m1_done"}, {"rep": "residents", "delta": 5}],
         "next": "m1_paid"},
        {"text": "Your nav core.",
         "if": [{"quest": "m2_chop_job"}, {"item": "nav_core"}, {"not_flag": "silk_fee_up"}],
         "do": [{"take": "nav_core"}, {"complete_quest": "m2_chop_job"}, {"credits": 1200}, {"flag": "m2_done"}],
         "next": "m2_paid"},
        {"text": "Your nav core.",
         "if": [{"quest": "m2_chop_job"}, {"item": "nav_core"}, {"flag": "silk_fee_up"}],
         "do": [{"take": "nav_core"}, {"complete_quest": "m2_chop_job"}, {"credits": 1500}, {"flag": "m2_done"}],
         "next": "m2_paid"},
        {"text": "Who's who down here?", "next": "who"},
        {"text": "Later.", "exit": true}
      ]
    },
    "m1_offer": {
      "say": [
        "The Drain Rats pulled two city sanitation workers out of the pump station on Tuesday. The city won't pay. Their families can't.",
        "Their union can, a little. Eight hundred for both, breathing. The storm drain in the Pit goes down; Nguyen knows the gate code, if you eat his noodles.",
        "Petra at the depot is one of the workers' sisters. Talk to her first. She has keys."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "I'll get them out.", "do": [{"start_quest": "m1_rat_trap"}], "next": "desk"},
        {"text": "Not yet.", "next": "desk"}
      ]
    },
    "m2_offer": {
      "say": [
        "The Scrap Kings stripped a courier van last week. There was a prototype nav core in it that belongs to someone who pays better than they do.",
        "It's in Crusher's office safe, in the Yard past Dace's checkpoint. Twelve hundred. Nobody needs to die for it, and I'd rather they didn't."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "Consider it stolen.", "do": [{"start_quest": "m2_chop_job"}], "next": "desk"},
        {"text": "Not yet.", "next": "desk"}
      ]
    },
    "fee_up": {"say": ["...You're cheaper than a funeral and more expensive than you look. Fine. Twenty-five percent."],
               "do": [{"flag": "silk_fee_up"}], "next": "desk"},
    "m1_paid": {"say": ["The union sends its thanks, and I send the money. Kessler will have better stock for you now."], "next": "desk"},
    "m2_paid": {"say": ["Clean work. The buyer will never know your name, which is the best compliment this city gives."], "next": "desk"},
    "who": {
      "say": [
        "Mags runs the bar and hears everything. Kessler sells hardware. Doc Vo stitches. Nguyen feeds the Sump.",
        "Officer Dace owns the checkpoint to the Yard and rents it out by the hour. Jax recruits for the Scrap Kings in Kiln. Skiv watches the Pit for the Rats.",
        "And Mouse knows every roof in the Tin Stacks, if you can find the kid."
      ],
      "next": "desk"
    }
  },
  "barks": {"greeting": ["Runner.", "Sit down, you're making Tank nervous."]}
}
